1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,400
Can I, or can you?

2
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:06,700
Can I open the window?

3
00:00:06,900 --> 00:00:10,000
I am asking for permission.

4
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:13,400
Can you open the window?

5
00:00:13,600 --> 00:00:17,000
I am asking you to help.

6
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:21,000
Look at who does the action.

7
00:00:21,200 --> 00:00:24,700
Your turn. May I sit here?

8
00:00:24,900 --> 00:00:29,600
Say: Can I sit here?

